        "original_id": "7eb67640-9431-5a3b-b193-091101211dd5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Société de Microélectronique et d'Horlogerie, The Swatch Group, SSIH, ASUAG, Glashütte Original\n- People: Nicolas Hayek\n- Topics: mergers, ownership, Swiss watch manufacturing\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Swiss Banks enforced the merger of SSIH and ASUAG into a new holding company originally named Société de Microélectronique et d'Horlogerie.\n- In 1983, Nicolas Hayek founded The Swatch Group from the merger of Allgemeine Gesellschaft der Schweizerischen Uhrenindustrie (ASUAG) and Société Suisse pour l'Industrie Horlogère (SSIH).\n- The Swatch Group is the current name of Société de Microélectronique et d'Horlogerie.\n- The Swatch Group is a Swiss manufacturer of watches and jewelry.\n- Glashütte Original is currently owned by The Swatch Group.",
